  "description": "<p>This personalized nautical doormat adds a distinctive touch to any boat, dock, or marine-themed space. Featuring a custom anchor design, it allows for personalization with a boat name or location, making it a unique welcome mat. Crafted for durability and comfort, it enhances the aesthetic of marine environments while offering a soft underfoot feel.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Customizable with boat name, family name, or location for a unique welcome.</li>\n<li>Features vibrant maritime colors and anchor designs for a stylish nautical look.</li>\n<li>Made with high-quality polyester and soft memory sponge for comfort.</li>\n<li>Includes anti-slip pads to keep the mat securely in place.</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain, suitable for high-traffic areas.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Repellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Anchor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Shake outdoors, vacuum, or wipe clean with a damp cloth</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is suitable for use in cabins, on ships, yachts, fishing boats, docks, marina entries, and coastal homes. Its versatile design allows it to be used both indoors and outdoors, making it ideal for various marine and home settings.</p>",
